    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; vertical-align: top; text-align: left; padding-bottom: 1.5pt">Pro forma as adjusted net tangible book value per share after this offering</TD><TD STYLE="padding-bottom: 1.5pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: left">$</TD><TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: right">0.79</TD><TD STYLE="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; text-align: left">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; vertical-align: top; text-align: left">Increase per share to new investors</TD><TD>&nbsp;</TD>
