    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">the date on which the right to exercise
        the warrants will commence, and the date on which the right will expire;</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
